Zero Zero UFO: controls
=======================

From the author's read-me (ReadMe-ZeroZeroUFO):

  Cursor keys or W A S D   fly the UFO
  Space or Z               tractor beam: lift cows (they mend your armour)
                           and soldiers
  Return or X              shoot the way you are flying
                           (beam and shoot together shoots down, with the
                           first weapon)
  F1                       help screen
  F2                       set up keyboard, mouse or joystick
  Esc or F10               quit
  Space                    skip the intro screens

Kill every enemy to reach the next wave. Touching the ground hurts.
The settings are kept in the drawer's User drawer, User/game.cfg.
